{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q168790","formula":"C₁₆H₂₄O₄","hill":"C16H24O4","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":16.0,"H":24.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Brefeldin A","ru":"Брефельдин A"},"descriptions":{"en":"Brefeldin A is a lactone antiviral produced by the fungus Penicillium brefeldianum. Brefeldin A inhibits protein transport from the endoplasmic reticulum to the golgi complex indirectly by preventing association of COP-I coat to the Golgi membrane. Brefeldin A was initially isolated with hopes to become an antiviral drug but is now primarily used in research to study protein transport.","ru":"Брефельдин А — антибиотик, производимый грибками Eupenicillium brefeldianum. Брефельдин широко применяется в исследованиях в молекулярной биологии в качестве вещества, блокирующего внутриклеточный транспорт из эндоплазматического ретикулума в аппарат Гольджи."},"fame":12,"pubchemCid":5287620,"mass":280.36,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H]1CCC/C=C/[C@@H]2C[C@@H](C[C@H]2[C@@H](/C=C/C(=O)O1)O)O","inchikey":"KQNZDYYTLMIZCT-KQPMLPITSA-N","iupac":"(1R,2R,3E,7S,11E,13S,15S)-2,15-dihydroxy-7-methyl-6-oxabicyclo[11.3.0]hexadeca-3,11-dien-5-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5287620","atoms":44,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.619,"y":-1.296,"z":-0.875,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.318,"y":2.94,"z":-0.487,"el":"O"},{"x":2.783,"y":0.626,"z":0.678,"el":"O"},{"x":2.523,"y":1.91,"z":-1.234,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.413,"y":0.559,"z":-0.105,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.84,"y":-0.699,"z":0.603,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.864,"y":0.627,"z":0.395,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.066,"y":-1.566,"z":0.971,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.288,"y":-0.832,"z":0.429,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.644,"y":1.866,"z":0.171,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.863,"y":-1.468,"z":-0.252,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.235,"y":1.805,"z":-0.346,"el":"C"},{"x":0.375,"y":-1.809,"z":0.141,"el":"C"},{